oth made it to the semi-finals, where Yazdani easily defeated (7-1) ROC team member " [:a {:href "/athletes/146290"} "Artur Nayfonov"] ". Taylor met Punia in the semis and dominated him, winning by technical superiority (10-0) in 2:49, setting up a re-match of Yazdani and Taylor."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final was very close, but Taylor made it three wins in a row over Yazdani, defeating him on points, 4-3. Nayfonov won his repêchage final to secure a bronze medal, but Punia was defeated by Sammarinese " [:a {:href "/athletes/146570"} "Myles Nazem Amine"] " for the other bronze."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Classification Points", :class "footnote"} "CP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Fall", :class "footnote"} "VF"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Technical Superiority", :class "footnote"} "ST"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points", :class "footnote"} "TP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points Received", :class "footnote"} "TPR"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/147505"} "David Taylor"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "15"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "3"] [:td {} "37"] [:td {} "5"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/134498"} "Hassan Yazdani"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/IRI"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-fl